---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import LegalPage from "../components/LegalPage.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy - Dentist For You"
  description="How Dentist For You collects, uses, and protects personal information."
>
  <main>
    <LegalPage
      title="Privacy Policy"
      description="This policy explains how Dentist For You (“we”, “us”) handles personal information collected through our website and clinic."
    >
      <section>
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          Dentist For You is a dental clinic at Central Jail Road, opp. Varuna Garden, Varanasi.
          You can reach us at
          <a href="tel:+919935027027">+91 99350 27027</a>
          or
          <a href="mailto:hello@dentalforyou.com">hello@dentalforyou.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>We may collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Name, phone number, email, and preferred appointment details when you use our booking or contact forms</li>
          <li>Messages you send about treatment interest or questions</li>
          <li>Technical data such as pages visited, device type, and approximate location, through Vercel Analytics</li>
          <li>Information you share when you contact us on WhatsApp, Instagram, or Facebook</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not ask you to submit clinical records, X-rays, or payment details through this website.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>How we use information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to enquiries and schedule visits</li>
          <li>To understand how the website is used and improve it</li>
          <li>To comply with applicable law and protect the clinic, staff, and patients</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Contact and booking forms open WhatsApp with the details you entered so our team can continue the conversation.
          Do not include sensitive health information you would not want sent over WhatsApp.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Sharing</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell your personal information. We may share it with service providers who host this website
          (including Vercel), analytics tools, and messaging platforms you choose to use (such as WhatsApp),
          and when the law requires us to do so.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Enquiry details are kept only as long as needed to handle your request and for reasonable clinic records,
          unless a longer period is required by law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          You may ask us to access, update, or delete enquiry information we hold, subject to legal and clinical record duties.
          Contact us using the details above.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>
          Parents or guardians should submit enquiries for patients under 18. We do not knowingly collect children’s data through the website for marketing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The “Last updated” date at the top will change when we do.</p>
      </section>
    </LegalPage>
  </main>
</Layout>
